        <mxCell id="3sWlMLupkF2iSEBTMSYG-28" parent="1" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;" value="Floor managment" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="30" x="780" y="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3sWlMLupkF2iSEBTMSYG-42" edge="1" parent="1" source="3sWlMLupkF2iSEBTMSYG-23" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.643;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="3sWlMLupkF2iSEBTMSYG-9">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3sWlMLupkF2iSEBTMSYG-55" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;1. Actors of the system&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The actors of the system are:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client:&lt;/strong&gt; makes reservations, makes online payments, and can add consumptions during the stay.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Receptionist:&lt;/strong&gt; verifies reservations, searches for available rooms, performs check-in and checkout, and receives payments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cashier:&lt;/strong&gt; adds the client&#39;s consumptions to the invoice.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cleaning Staff:&lt;/strong&gt; cleans rooms and updates their cleaning status.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Floor Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; verifies room cleaning, makes rooms available, and reports room damages.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client&#39;s Bank Server:&lt;/strong&gt; validates online payments made by CIB card.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;2. Actions that occur outside the system&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The following actions occur outside the hotel management system:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Making a reservation by &lt;strong&gt;phone&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validating the online payment&lt;/strong&gt; by the client&#39;s bank server.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical cleaning&lt;/strong&gt; of the rooms by the cleaning staff.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical maintenance and repair&lt;/strong&gt; of damaged rooms.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical receipt of payment&lt;/strong&gt; by the receptionist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;3. Functional boundaries / modules of the system&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The system can be divided into the following functional boundaries:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reservation Management:&lt;/strong&gt; making and verifying reservations and handling online payments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Room Management:&lt;/strong&gt; searching for available rooms and managing room statuses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Management:&lt;/strong&gt; handling check-in, creating stays, and handling checkout.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Billing Management:&lt;/strong&gt; creating and managing invoices, adding consumptions, and receiving payments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cleaning Management:&lt;/strong&gt; managing room cleaning and updating cleaning statuses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance Management:&lt;/strong&gt; managing damaged or unavailable rooms and restoring their availability after maintenance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="740" width="920" x="-50" y="-770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
